    base: combined bottom bases cover most but not all columns, leaving some edge background
  guide:
    count: 0 or 1
    shape: optional upper guide/ramp entering from a left or right grid edge; each arm is 4-connected
    variants: one sloped arm or a two-arm bottom-open funnel
