  16:     Rule:
  17:     - Maroon pixels connected to the destination through floor/maroon cells (not blocked by walls) are candidates.
  18:     - Rank candidates by distance to the destination; the closest ones fill the block in row-major order.
  19:     - Moved maroons are erased (replaced with floor color).
